{"title": "US Senator Lindsey Graham Dies at 71 After Brief and Sudden Illness", "summary": "Lindsey Graham, a key ally of former US President Donald Trump, died on July 11 after a brief and sudden illness. He was 71 years old. Graham had served in the Senate since 2003 and was known for his sharp criticism of Trump before becoming one of his most loyal backers.", "summary_points": ["US Senator Lindsey Graham has passed away at 71 due to a brief and sudden illness.", "Graham was a key ally of former US President Donald Trump.", "He had served in the Senate since 2003.", "The cause of death is not specified.", "Graham's death comes after he recently announced his retirement from politics."], "title_hi": "अमेरिकी सीनेटर लिंडसे ग्राहम का निधन हुआ 71 वर्ष की आयु में", "summary_hi": "लिंडसे ग्राहम, राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प के एक महत्वपूर्ण सहयोगी के रूप में, 11 जुलाई को एक सudden और अस्थायी बीमारी के कारण निधन हो गया। वह 71 वर्ष के थे। ग्राहम ने 2003 से सीनेट में काम किया था और ट्रम्प के खिलाफ तेज़ आलोचक के रूप में जाना जाता था, लेकिन बाद में उनकी सबसे वफादार सहयोगियों में से एक बन गए।", "summary_points_hi": ["अमेरिकी सीनेटर लिंडसे ग्राहम का निधन हुआ 71 वर्ष की आयु में।", "ग्राहम राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प के एक महत्वपूर्ण सहयोगी थे।", "वह 2003 से सीनेट में काम करते रहे।", "बीमारी का कारण निर्धारित नहीं किया गया है।", "ग्राहम की मृत्यु उनके राजनीतिक सेवानिवृत्ति के बाद हुई थी।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize Graham's role as a Trump ally and his sharp criticism of the former president before becoming one of his most loyal backers. They also highlight his long tenure in the Senate.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames Graham's death as a sudden and unexpected event, focusing on the cause of his illness and the impact of his passing on the US political landscape.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets focus on Graham's conservative credentials and his role as a key ally of Trump. They also emphasize the significance of his retirement from politics."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वामपंथी समाचार एजेंसियाँ ग्राहम के रूप में ट्रम्प के सहयोगी के रूप में और उनके ट्रम्प से पहले तेज़ आलोचक के रूप में जाने वाले ग्राहम को प्रमुखता देती हैं। उन्होंने सीनेट में लंबे समय तक काम किया।", "center": "केंद्रीय समाचार एजेंसियाँ ग्राहम की मृत्यु को एक अचानक और अप्रत्याशित घटना के रूप में पेश करती हैं, जिसमें उनकी बीमारी का कारण और उनकी मृत्यु का राजनीतिक परिणाम शामिल है।", "right": "दाएंपंथी समाचार एजेंसियाँ ग्राहम के संरक्षात्मक विचारों और ट्रम्प के सहयोगी के रूप में उनकी प्रमुखता देती हैं। उन्होंने अपने राजनीतिक सेवानिवृत्ति पर भी जोर दिया।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/pfl44y/article71213313.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/2026-07-12T062148Z_1067010637_RC22BMA9EEIT_RTRMADP_3_PEOPLE-LINDSEY-GRAHAM.JPG", "sources": [{"source": "Firstpost", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "US Senator Lindesy Graham dies at 71 due to 'sudden illness'"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-senator-lindsey-graham-passes-away-july-12-2026/article71213307.ece", "headline": "U.S. Senator Lindsey Graham passes away at 71"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/brief-sudden-illness-lindsey-graham-us-senator-and-trump-ally-dies-at-71/articleshow/132341650.cms", "headline": "'Brief, sudden illness': Lindsey Graham, US senator and Trump ally, dies at 71"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/republican-senator-lindsey-graham-passes-away-from-a-brief-and-sudden-illness-11783838165556.html", "headline": "US Senator Lindsey Graham passes away at 71 from a brief and sudden illness"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "lang